infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Two dedup patterns, one race-condition gap
  compares
    - label SELECT-then-act
      children
        - label Two steps, not atomic
          desc Check first, then INSERT + side effect separately
        - label Races under concurrent delivery
          desc Two consumers SELECT not-found, both charge
        - label Crash window stays open
          desc Marked processed but work undone skips forever
    - label INSERT-first transaction
      children
        - label One atomic transaction
          desc BEGIN, INSERT dedup row, side effect, COMMIT
        - label UNIQUE constraint stops dups
          desc Concurrent INSERT violates, rolls back, skips safely
        - label No window between insert and effect
          desc Crash after COMMIT redelivers and rolls back cleanly
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
